		<DT Nm="FB_MixPumpControl" AT="2" Cmt="&#10;    FB_MixPumpControl&#10;    - English comments&#10;    - Pressure in mmH2O&#10;    - Uses OSCAT CTRL_PID (v3.33): SUP = DIFF deadband (mmH2O), OFS adds to output Y&#10;    - Includes PV input filter (OSCAT PT1)&#10;    - Includes Jet-to-Wire computation (wire speed in m/min, ratio unitless)&#10;    - Includes ratio tuning via OSCAT TUNE2 (increment/decrement buttons with min/max/step)&#10;    - VFD supervision with RUN feedback timeout&#10;" Ext="736">
			<SI Nm="allInterlocksOK" Tp="BOOL" Ext="219" />
			<SI Nm="autoMode" Tp="BOOL" Ext="10" />
			<SI Nm="deviceState" Tp="STRING(80)" Ext="110" />
			<SI Nm="enableInputFilter" Tp="BOOL" Ext="85" />
			<SI Nm="faultActive" Tp="BOOL" Ext="109" />
			<SI Nm="faultMsg" Tp="STRING(80)" Ext="256" />
