		<DT Nm="FB_HeadboxLipsPWMControl" AT="2" Cmt="&#10;    FB_HeadboxLipsPWMControl&#10;    Purpose:&#10;      - Control headbox lips opening using ON/OFF modulation (PWM), no analog speed output.&#10;      - Manual: open/close while buttons are pressed (jog).&#10;      - Automatic: operator types a target opening [mm] and presses &quot;adjust&quot;; the FB drives&#10;        the lips toward the target using PWM duty proportional to position error magnitude.&#10;      - If manualOpenCmd or manualCloseCmd is pressed during automatic positioning, the FB&#10;        immediately returns to manual mode.&#10;&#10;    Features:&#10;      - Position units in millimeters (mm).&#10;      - Limit sensors (limitMaxSensor / limitMinSensor) inhibit motion.&#10;      - PWM duty [%] from |positionError| with clamps (min/max duty).&#10;      - Minimum ON time per direction (minOnTime) to protect contactors.&#10;      - Stall detection and travel timeout.&#10;      - Exclusive actuation (never open &amp; close simultaneously).&#10;      - Human-readable deviceState.&#10;&#10;    Notes:&#10;      - Single PWM generator; direction is applied by gating its pulse.&#10;      - Target is clamped to [posMin_mm .. posMax_mm].&#10;" Ext="456">
			<SI Nm="autoActive" Tp="BOOL" Ext="172" />
			<SI Nm="autoAdjustCmd" Tp="BOOL" Ext="28" />
			<SI Nm="autoAdjustOld" Tp="BOOL" Ext="173" />
			<SI Nm="autoTargetInput_mm" Tp="REAL" Ext="24" />
			<SI Nm="busy" Tp="BOOL" Ext="70" />
			<SI Nm="closePulseAllowed" Tp="BOOL" Ext="257" />
			<SI Nm="closingCmd" Tp="BOOL" Ext="69" />
			<SI Nm="desiredTarget_mm" Tp="REAL" Ext="248" />
			<SI Nm="deviceState" Tp="STRING(80)" Ext="73" />
			<SI Nm="done" Tp="BOOL" Ext="71" />
			<SI Nm="faultActive" Tp="BOOL" Ext="72" />
			<SI Nm="instPWM" Tp="CPNTeck_OSCAT_BASIC.CTRL_PWM" Ext="328" />
			<SI Nm="lastPos_mm" Tp="REAL" Ext="180" />
			<SI Nm="limitMaxSensor" Tp="BOOL" Ext="20" />
			<SI Nm="limitMinSensor" Tp="BOOL" Ext="21" />
			<SI Nm="manualCloseCmd" Tp="BOOL" Ext="23" />
			<SI Nm="manualOpenCmd" Tp="BOOL" Ext="22" />
			<SI Nm="minOnTime" Tp="UDINT" Ext="52" />
			<SI Nm="needClose" Tp="BOOL" Ext="255" />
			<SI Nm="needOpen" Tp="BOOL" Ext="254" />
			<SI Nm="openPulseAllowed" Tp="BOOL" Ext="256" />
			<SI Nm="openingCmd" Tp="BOOL" Ext="68" />
