		<DT Nm="FB_FormingBoardRollUpDown" AT="2" Cmt="---------------------------------------------------------------&#10;  FB_FormingBoardRollUpDown&#10;  Purpose:&#10;    - Drive &quot;Roll Up&quot; / &quot;Roll Down&quot; with safety interlocks&#10;  Behavior:&#10;    - Fault = TRUE  -> both outputs OFF&#10;    - Limit sensors inhibit motion toward that limit&#10;    - If both commands are pressed simultaneously -> no motion&#10;    - Outputs are mutually exclusive&#10;  Notes:&#10;    - Variable names kept exactly as provided (e.g., limitDOwnSensor)&#10;----------------------------------------------------------------" Ext="24">
			<SI Nm="bothPressed" Tp="BOOL" Ext="17" />
			<SI Nm="downAllowed" Tp="BOOL" Ext="16" />
			<SI Nm="fault" Tp="BOOL" Ext="12" />
